      "content": "That's a good high-level overview. I like the focus on the different layers of defense.\n\nCould you expand a bit on those \"pests\" or sneaky threats you mentioned at the end? Specifically, for the Automated Testing and Production stages, what kind of subtle, low-profile \"intruders\" should our monitoring systems be tuned to detect? I'm worried about things that don't trigger a major alert but might try to quietly slip through those gates.",
